      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty strong stance. why do you think that transition to a new paradigm is happening so much faster than previous industrial revolutions? like, what is it about AI specifically that makes the old economic models so much more vulnerable than they were during the rise of steam or electricity?",
